  The article says the student was a 'கல்லூரி மாணவி' who died when a vehicle hit her while she tried to cross the road, which matches the draft. However, the article does not say the road widening was ever sent to the central government for approval or that the Transport Department's report was specifically a 'போக்குவரத்துத் துறை' report; the article says 'வட்டார போக்குவரத்து துறையினர்' (regional transport department) submitted the report, which is a minor naming difference but acceptable.
