  The reel_script and caption say the district administration 'அறிவுறுத்தியுள்ளது' a plastic speed breaker is to be installed, while the slide says 'மாவட்ட நிர்வாகம் அமைக்க அறிவுறுத்தியுள்ளது', which is an ungrammatical/unclear phrasing in Tamil: it suggests the district administration itself is to install it, which conflicts with the article's meaning that the district administration advised that such a breaker be installed.
